# Source: Technical Changes
changelog.2.1.0.0.d80295d6 = 
# Source: Various technical enhancements.
changelog.2.1.0.0.fe26324e = 
# Source: The "Create a mod" window now warns you about mismatches and other potentially unwanted behaviors, such as when you have not unlocked the target emote, when one of your own mods already changes it, or when the two emotes have turn, loop, sound or intro mismatches.
changelog.2.2.0.0.2323aeb2 = 
# Source: Fixed one of the signatures the plugin needed for the cache-breaker feature.\nWithout it, a swap could play the emote you played before it.
changelog.2.2.0.0.31b60c32 = 
# Source: New Features
changelog.2.2.0.0.36f4e595 = 
# Source: Fixed changing world turning off the generated Penumbra mod and its options.
changelog.2.2.0.0.4aabbfb7 = 
# Source: Emote overrides
changelog.2.2.0.0.587c7b7d = 
# Source: Bug fixes
changelog.2.2.0.0.60586b6e = 
# Source: Adds "Emote overrides", and various bug fixes and improvements.
changelog.2.2.0.0.679d7020 = 
# Source: Added the "Emote overrides" tab to the configuration window.\nPick a locked emote, then pick the emotes it is allowed to land on. Emote Swap will then use your list instead of finding a best match, in the order you put it in.\nIf none of them can be played, the plugin tells you which ones it skipped and why.
changelog.2.2.0.0.99ae3ed3 = 
# Source: Added "Support me on Ko-fi" and "Discord" buttons to the main window.
changelog.2.2.0.0.ac6010ab = 
# Source: The "Fav" and "Blocked" tabs of the main window now have their own dropdown, to add an emote to either list without hunting for it in the other tabs.
changelog.2.2.0.0.d4ad1225 = 
# Source: Technical Changes
changelog.2.2.0.0.d80295d6 = 
# Source: Fixed "Create a mod" sometimes writing the wrong animation instead of the one you asked for.
changelog.2.2.0.0.f2789edb = 
# Source: Various technical enhancements.
changelog.2.2.0.0.fe26324e = 
# Source: Animation refresh rework
changelog.2.3.0.0.07d79f01 = 
# Source: Reworked how the plugin refreshes an animation, it is now way more efficient and optimized. Dropped from 10+ sigs to 2.
changelog.2.3.0.0.105ef1de = 
# Source: Added "Add an override..." to the right click menu of the main UI.\nIt opens the "Emote overrides" tab with the emote already picked.
changelog.2.3.0.0.1284fd82 = 
# Source: New Features
changelog.2.3.0.0.36f4e595 = 
# Source: Bug fixes
changelog.2.3.0.0.60586b6e = 
# Source: "Always cache-break" no longer makes other players see you redraw for random emotes.
changelog.2.3.0.0.790f1b05 = 
# Source: Reworks how animations are refreshed, and stops other players from seeing you redraw.
changelog.2.3.0.0.a096b13e = 
# Source: Technical Changes
changelog.2.3.0.0.d80295d6 = 
# Source: Various technical enhancements.
changelog.2.3.0.0.fe26324e = 
# Source: Loop emotes no longer play your own idle mod instead of the emote you asked for.\nGenerated bypass mods priority was not correctly set, this is fixed now.
changelog.2.3.1.0.078d4ca5 = 
# Source: Idle pose fixes
changelog.2.3.1.0.0e591faf = 
# Source: Fixed a bug with "Only when nothing else fits" for "Loops on idle poses" where it ignored blocked emotes.
changelog.2.3.1.0.3b84d8da = 
# Source: Bug fixes
changelog.2.3.1.0.60586b6e = 
# Source: Fixed a bug where stopping a bypass on an idle animation by moving would not correctly stop the animation.
changelog.2.3.1.0.7e4e2d96 = 
# Source: Fixes loop emotes playing your own idle mod instead of the emote you asked for.
changelog.2.3.1.0.9ff59b49 = 
# Source: /belogs now exports everything the plugin did since it loaded.\nIt would only partially export logs when the dalamud log level was not properly set.
changelog.2.3.1.0.b5afd5f1 = 
# Source: The plugin reads its mod's priority back from Penumbra instead of taking the cached value.
changelog.2.3.1.0.c3cc6888 = 
# Source: Technical Changes
changelog.2.3.1.0.d80295d6 = 
# Source: Various technical enhancements.
changelog.2.3.1.0.fe26324e = 
# Source: Updated to the latest Penumbra API.
changelog.2.4.0.0.04292ed8 = 
# Source: Added a translation editor, accessible from the settings. You can translate the plugin in game, see your changes live and save them.\nTranslations or improvements are very much welcome. Please open an issue or a pull request on the plugin's GitHub if you'd like to contribute.
changelog.2.4.0.0.05c331b1 = 
# Source: Added Malou. Please take good care of him.
changelog.2.4.0.0.12192c44 = 
# Source: Fixed mods that replace an emote's timeline (.tmb) files not being taken into account by Emote Swap.
changelog.2.4.0.0.1856a1c1 = 
# Source: /be sync now also restarts the sounds and VFXs of your emotes in Emote Swap mode as well, try it!
changelog.2.4.0.0.1c445d74 = 
# Source: Locked emotes are now listed in the game's own emote window.\nYou can search locked emotes and use them from there. Also added an option to grey or un-grey them from your hotbars, and this applies to the Emote game window as well.
changelog.2.4.0.0.228e7d9a = 
# Source: /belogs now exports more information, to help figuring out what went wrong.
changelog.2.4.0.0.29c642fa = 
# Source: New Features
changelog.2.4.0.0.36f4e595 = 
# Source: Various bug fixes over the versions.
changelog.2.4.0.0.39c46762 = 
# Source: Fixed swapped animations parsing in VFXEditor.
changelog.2.4.0.0.52e06c34 = 
# Source: Swapping an emote is now slightly faster.
changelog.2.4.0.0.56686f6e = 
# Source: Bug fixes
changelog.2.4.0.0.60586b6e = 
# Source: Added translations.\nThe plugin is now available in French, German, Japanese, Korean and Simplified Chinese.You can pick your language in the settings.
changelog.2.4.0.0.6afdbd23 = 
# Source: New interface & translations
changelog.2.4.0.0.6e05d893 = 
# Source: Both interfaces are now built on NoireLib's new interface system.
changelog.2.4.0.0.7700f1ca = 
# Source: Removed the outdated mod writer.
changelog.2.4.0.0.973a6508 = 
# Source: Adds a brand new interface, translations, shows your locked emotes in the game's own emote window and fix some issues with modded animations.
changelog.2.4.0.0.9f4cc7be = 
# Source: Fixed bypassing emotes from your hotbars on the Chinese client.
changelog.2.4.0.0.a57ef1dd = 
# Source: Added a "Compact rows" option to make the emote list smaller. On by default.
changelog.2.4.0.0.c0c846f7 = 
# Source: Technical Changes
changelog.2.4.0.0.d80295d6 = 
# Source: Added a brand new interface, which is now the default one.\nEvery window has been redesigned: the main UI, the settings, "Create a mod", the hotbar assignment, the changelog and the logs.\nIf you prefer the old look, you can switch back to the classic interface at any time in the settings.
changelog.2.4.0.0.da488787 = 
# Source: The new interface has its own window settings, click the Window Options button next to the close button. It allows you to adjust opacity, text size, make the plugin always on top, click through, lock its position, its width and/or height, and make the windows stay visible in gpose, when the UI is hidden, during cutscenes, or when the game hides its own UI.
changelog.2.4.0.0.e862aedf = 
# Source: Added a preview popup next to the main UI. Click an emote to make it appear. In Emote Swap mode, it will show you which of your emotes it will play through, offer you to play it, add it to your favorites, block it, assign it to a hotbar or play it on your minion, pet or chocobo.\nDouble click an emote to play it right away. You can turn the popup off in the settings.
changelog.2.4.0.0.e94a5ffa = 
# Source: Various technical enhancements.
changelog.2.4.0.0.fe26324e = 
# Source: You cannot bypass this emote right now.
chat.cannot_bypass_now = 지금은 이 감정 표현을 우회할 수 없습니다.
# Source: Error trying to process command
chat.command.failed = 명령어를 처리하는 중 오류가 발생했습니다
# Source: Emote or command not found: {arg}
chat.command.not_found = 감정 표현이나 명령어를 찾을 수 없습니다: {arg}
# Source: This emote cannot be played in Emote Swap mode.
chat.command.not_in_swap = 이 감정 표현은 Emote Swap 모드에서 사용할 수 없습니다.
# Source: No chocobo summoned.
chat.command.no_chocobo = 소환한 초코보가 없습니다.
# Source: No minion summoned.
chat.command.no_minion = 소환한 꼬마 친구가 없습니다.
